[I] Library to render tracker music to a PCM audio stream

[T] libopenmpt is a library to render tracker music (MOD, XM, S3M, IT, MPTM
[T] and dozens of other legacy formats) to a PCM audio stream. It is
[T] directly based on the OpenMPT tracker, offering the same playback
[T] quality and format support, and includes the openmpt123 command-line
[T] player.

[U] https://lib.openmpt.org

[A] OpenMPT
[M] andrei32 <andrei32.t2@gmail.com>

[C] extra/tool
[F] CROSS

